# Wireframe: Issue Creation (teamId Data Flow)

## Purpose & Flow Context

No visual layout changes. This is a data-flow fix: `teamId` is added to the POST body when creating an issue. The IssuesPage and IssueFormModal retain their existing visual wireframes.

## Data Flow Annotation

```
[Sidebar: TeamSelector]
  │  user selects team → onSelect(teamId)
  │
  ▼
[TeamStore (shared Zustand store)]
  │  stores currentTeamId
  │
  ▼
[IssuesPage: handleCreateIssue]
  │  reads currentTeamId from TeamStore
  │  calls createIssue({ ...data, teamId })
  │
  ▼
[createIssue API]
  │  POST /issues { title, description, status, priority, assigneeId, labels, teamId }
  │
  ▼
[API / MSW handler]
  │  validates teamId is present and non-empty
  │  returns 201 with created issue
  │
  ▼
[IssuesStore: addIssue]
  │  issue added to local state, UI updates
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| TeamSelector dropdown | Custom (TeamSelector) | On select, writes to TeamStore | No teams loaded: disabled state |
| "New Issue" button | Button | Opens IssueFormModal | Disabled if no team selected: tooltip "Select a team first" |
| Submit button | Button | POST with teamId | Disabled while submitting; error toast on failure |

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "New Issue" button label | "New Issue" | Opens create modal |
| Toast success | "Issue created" | Confirm creation |
| Toast error | "Failed to create issue" | Generic error, details in sheet |
| No-team tooltip | "Select a team first" | Guides user to sidebar |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Unchanged from existing layout. The create flow works as before, but `teamId` is now included in the API request.

### Empty

No change. Empty state shows "No issues yet" + CTA (disabled if no team selected).

### Loading

No change. Shows skeleton bars for issue cards.

### Error

If `createIssue` fails (network or validation), error toast displayed. If missing team context: "Select a team before creating issues" message shown.

### Success

Issue added to list, success toast shown, modal closes.
